# Remote Cursor Workspace (Default for All Work)

All Cursor and AI agent development for Impilo vNext happens on the **VM Remote SSH
workspace** (Web Preview / Engineering Control), never on the local laptop clone.

> **Dual-VM model:** `impilo.mohcc.gov.zw` = web preview / engineering control (this rule).  
> `41.57.127.218` = Android Maestro sandbox only — see `.cursor/rules/mobile-android-sandbox.mdc`.

## Canonical workspace (Web Preview / Engineering Control)

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| Remote SSH target | `robert@impilo.mohcc.gov.zw:2276` |
| Repo path (open this folder) | `/opt/impilo/repos/Impilo-vNext` |
| Active working branch | `claude/staging-ux-orchestration-remediation-Yypyl` (unless explicitly changed) |
| Preview URL | `https://impilo.mohcc.gov.zw` |
| Source of truth | **GitHub** `rtgongora/Impilo-vNext` |

## Mobile Android Sandbox (separate VM)

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| SSH | `facility@41.57.127.218:2027` |
| Role | Android emulator, Maestro smoke — **not** backend deploy |
| Mobile API | `EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://impilo.mohcc.gov.zw` |
| Sync | Same branch via Git — no divergent unpushed work across VMs |

Docs: `docs/environment/DUAL_VM_OPERATING_MODEL.md`, `docs/mobile/MOBILE_ANDROID_SANDBOX.md`.

## Rules

1. **GitHub is the source of truth.** The VM disk is the working copy; always push to GitHub.
2. **The VM is the primary development workspace.** Connect Cursor via Remote SSH to
   `robert@impilo.mohcc.gov.zw:2276` and open `/opt/impilo/repos/Impilo-vNext`.
3. **The local laptop clone must not be used for normal development.** The laptop is only
   the Cursor client and the browser-testing machine. All dependency installation, builds,
   tests, Docker/image builds, k3s deployment, smoke tests, and logs run on the **235** VM.
4. **Do not run Android emulator load on 235.** Maestro / emulator runtime validation runs on **218** (`facility@41.57.127.218:2027`).
5. The active branch is `claude/staging-ux-orchestration-remediation-Yypyl` unless the user
   explicitly instructs otherwise. Confirm the branch before starting work.
6. **Pull latest before starting new work**; work on feature/fix branches where appropriate.

## Quality gates (VM-first)

Before preview deploy authorization, run on the VM:

```bash
bash scripts/pipeline/run-local-quality-gates.sh
bash scripts/pipeline/cursor-local-feedback.sh
```

GitHub Actions calls the same scripts when runners are available. See `docs/environment/DUAL_MODE_TEST_PIPELINE.md`.

## Always run before starting work

```bash
cd /opt/impilo/repos/Impilo-vNext
git status
git branch --show-current
git rev-parse --short HEAD
git remote -v
```

Confirm the branch is `claude/staging-ux-orchestration-remediation-Yypyl` unless the user has
explicitly instructed otherwise, then `git pull` before making changes.

## Verify the workspace

```bash
bash scripts/dev/verify-remote-cursor-workspace.sh
```

Browser testing happens on the laptop against `https://impilo.mohcc.gov.zw`.
